@api = http://localhost:3000
@token = REEMPLAZAR_JWT

### 1) Crear vacante con todos los campos relevantes
POST {{api}}/recruiter/vacancies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Desarrollador Full Stack",
  "area": "Ingenieria",
  "modality": "hybrid",
  "location": "Bogota",
  "contractType": "full-time",
  "seniority": "mid",
  "vacancies": 2,
  "salaryMin": 3500,
  "salaryMax": 5000,
  "description": "Desarrollo y mantenimiento de aplicaciones web para productos internos.",
  "responsibilities": [
    "Desarrollar nuevas features",
    "Corregir bugs criticos"
  ],
  "requiredSkills": [
    "React",
    "Node.js"
  ],
  "optionalSkills": [
    "Docker",
    "AWS"
  ]
}

### 2) Listar mis vacantes y validar persistencia de campos
GET {{api}}/recruiter/vacancies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) (Opcional) Validacion negativa: salaryMax < salaryMin
POST {{api}}/recruiter/vacancies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "QA Engineer",
  "area": "Calidad",
  "modality": "remote",
  "location": "Medellin",
  "contractType": "full-time",
  "seniority": "mid",
  "vacancies": 1,
  "salaryMin": 6000,
  "salaryMax": 3000,
  "description": "Pruebas funcionales y automatizadas.",
  "responsibilities": ["Ejecutar pruebas"],
  "requiredSkills": ["Testing"],
  "optionalSkills": ["Playwright"]
}

### Esperado:
### - Backend responde 400/422 si aplica validacion salaryMax >= salaryMin.
### - Si backend no valida aun, registrar pendiente tecnico.
